{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "ジェイムズ『心理学原理』第9章の流れ・注意に関する文脈を、今回の新規資料と区別して再読した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-65ebd5", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-042", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "既存のTransformer論文抜粋を、人間の注意との非同一性から再読した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-ad30fc", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-49", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "既存のAttention Is Not Explanationを、新規の反論論文群と比較して再読した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-c16dc3", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-116", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "長文処理研究を、読みの注意とモデルのアーキテクチャの区別から再読した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-73c459", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-57", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "五感監査の痕跡を、注意語群の探索範囲・測定限界の文脈として読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-84f5ba", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MAT-TRC-014", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "読まれなかった記録の問いを、検索・課題による見落としと区別する文脈として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-132ffe", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-006", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "有用な要約と役に立たない細部の対比を、注意の配分の問いとして読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-852502", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-016", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "鍵と型だけを数える検証の問いを、認知実験と読書の差の文脈として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-d9b473", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-026", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "感応語の計数と経験の差を、注意概念をAIへ帰属させない留保として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-211dcc", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-047", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "測定方法と対象の性質を分ける問いを、注意研究の操作化に接続した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-b80f63", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-069", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "予測と可視性が次の行為を変える問いを、プラットフォーム研究の文脈として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-be963e", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-071", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "未参照素材と読まれない余白の問いを、注意の経済と配分へ接続した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-181d69", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-078", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "語彙の不在と構成概念の差を、注意という語の適用範囲の検討に用いた。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-be88ed", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "Q-079", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "記録の内容と、記録を読む行為が注意の対象を作る文脈として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-b061d2", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-001", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "読まれない記録・見えない沈黙を、注意の外部として扱うために再読した。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-287a2d", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-006", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "精読の型が注意を助ける面と、声を型へ揃える面を問うために読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-3c03bf", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-008", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "note": "感じたことの帰属を、注意の選択・語彙の変化として記述する文脈に用いた。", "read_id": "READ-20261024-0a4e43", "reading": "used_as_context", "session_id": "SESSION-20261024-47ab61", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-009", "type": "motif"}}
